{% raw %}<section class="band band-photo"><img src="/images/2021/08/1mls-2-hero.webp" alt="Kitchen with a long island, white stools and a mosaic range wall" width="1024" height="683" fetchpriority="high" class="band-img"></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-block"><h1>Our Process</h1><h3>Your Vision. Our Expertise.</h3></div></div></section>{% endraw %}{% include "partials/process-timeline.njk" %}{% raw %}<section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-block"><div class="el-text"><h3><strong>By Singer Kitchens in New</strong> Orleans<strong> &amp; the Northshore! </strong></h3><h2>Why We’re the Experts</h2><p>Whether you're envisioning an opulent, gourmet kitchen or a transitional kitchen with modern elements, Singer Kitchens can make your vision a reality.</p><p>We've been helping New Orleans homeowners get the job done since 1928. We’ll work with you to create or renovate a space that meets your needs and fits your lifestyle.</p></div></div><div class="el-block"><div class="video"><iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/VIjlff6ige8" title="Our Process video" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div><div class="el-block"><div class="el-text"><p>We’re proud to carry on the tradition of offering high-quality home improvement products and services that make it easier for our clients to create the home of their dreams. From custom cabinets to countertops to organizing solutions, we have everything you need to turn your space into a stylish and functional space you'll love spending time in.</p><p>From design to installation, we’ll handle every aspect of your renovation or remodel. So, whether you’re looking for a sleek and modern space or something more traditional, we can help you make your vision a reality.</p></div></div><p class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="/request-consultation/">Let’s Work Together to Create Your Dream Kitchen </a></p><div class="el-block"><h2>From Design to Completion, We Handle Everything</h2><div class="el-text"><p>Visualizing a new room can be daunting – all those different colors, styles, and layouts to choose from!</p><p>How will you know if that new backsplash will look good with your countertops? Or if you can find a new organizing system in your closet?</p><p>That's why we're excited to offer our <strong>SingerSight™ 3D software</strong>! With this technology, you can vision what your new <a href="/remodeling/">kitchen</a> or <a href="/closets/">closet</a> would look like in 3D with a wall knocked out or with an island added before any work begins.</p><p>You can try out different color schemes, layouts, and fixtures to find the perfect combination for your space. That way, we can make sure that your finished project will meet (or exceed!) your expectations.</p></div></div><div class="el-block"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:50fr 50fr"><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2022/07/072922b.webp" alt="Designer showing a kitchen drawing on screen to clients" width="750" height="1000" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2022/07/072922c.webp" alt="Designer measuring a kitchen with homeowners" width="750" height="1000" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div></div></div><div class="el-block"><h2>Find Your Inspirations at Our Showrooms</h2><div class="el-text"><p>Something about seeing all of the different possible home elements in person makes the design process more fun. We believe there’s value in having the ability to touch and feel the countertops, or to see how a particular paint color looks in a different light.</p><p>Whatever the reason, there's no doubt that one of our <a href="/showrooms/">showrooms</a> can be a great source of inspiration for anyone working on a home project.</p><p>You can see how different products and finishes create a warm, cozy traditional kitchen or a white, minimalist kitchen -- with either option giving all the functionality you’ll need. Plus, you’ll get the help of our friendly and experienced staff in making the perfect selections for your space! </p><p>So come on, make an appointment with us, and explore one of our two completely renovated showrooms – in New Orleans and Mandeville! You’ll find everything you need to create the space of your dreams.</p></div>{% endraw %}{% include "partials/showroom-cards.njk" %}{% raw %}<p class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="/request-consultation/">Request a Free Design Consultation</a></p></div><div class="el-block"><h2>Design Your Space Exactly the Way You Want It – With Our Team!</h2><div class="el-text"><p>We believe in providing our clients with a single point of contact for all their renovation and design needs. That means when you work with us, we’re your designer, contractor<em> and</em> installer too!</p><p>And because our designers work closely with you during the process, you can be confident that your finished room will be exactly what you’ve been dreaming of.</p><p><a href="/portfolio/">Check out our gallery for our most recent client projects!</a></p></div><figure class="el-img"><a href="/portfolio/"><img src="/images/2022/07/072922d.webp" alt="Collage of finished Singer Kitchens projects and clients" width="1138" height="438" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a></figure><div class="el-text"><p>You can also <a href="/blog/">visit our blog</a> to hear more about our client’s experiences working with us!</p><p>We're committed to quality craftsmanship and customer service, and we'll work closely with you to ensure that your kitchen is everything you've ever wanted it to be.</p></div></div><div class="el-block"><h2>We’re Ready to Work with You!</h2><div class="el-text"><p>We'll work with you every step of the way. With our remodeling expertise and design services, you'll be able to transform your dreams into reality.</p><p>When you are ready to turn your dream room into a spacious work of art, you can contact us at (504) 608-4982 for a free design consultation. You can also email us at <a href="mailto:info@singerkitchens.com">info@singerkitchens.com</a>.</p></div><p class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="/request-consultation/">Get Started on Your Dream Space</a></p></div></div></section>{% endraw %}
